  "suffix_newline_count": 108,
  "suffix_head": "\n---\n\n## rc 码表·实测各批码位登记（REM-22 / B5+B6 追加节；owner 裁定 T1-19）\n\n",
  "frozen_anchors": [
   {
    "text": "## rc 码表（冻结；owner 裁定 T1-19 / §13）",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "同一批内 rc 语义必须自洽，但**跨批历史 rc 不回改**。今后各批**必须**在自身证据里带一份",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "自描述 `exit_code_legend`，并在 `commands.json` / `case_results.js",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "**冻结码表（本包唯一规范值）**",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "| rc | 含义 | 判据 |",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "|---|---|---|",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "| `0` | 通过 | 命令正常结束，且**业务判定为通过**（外层 runner 退出 0 不能覆盖子命令失败） |",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "| `1` | harness 失败 | 测试/运行器自身出错：导入失败、夹具错误、期望文件缺失、路径未绑定 |",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "| `2` | 无裁决 / 预期拒绝 | 用例是负例且**业务上被正确拒绝**；或该命令不产生裁决（如只读查询） |",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "| `3` | 未达预期 | 正例未通过，或负例**未被拒绝**；即“应红未红 / 应绿未绿” |",
    "present_in_current_file": false,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": false
   },
   {
    "text": "**已知的历史偏差（只登记、不回改）**",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "- M05–M08 用 `2 = harness`。",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   },
   {
    "text": "- M09–M16 等用 `1 = harness / 2 = no-verdict / 3 = negative`。",
    "present_in_current_file": true,
    "present_in_9895_prefix": true
   }
  ],
  "frozen_anchors_all_present_current": false,
  "frozen_anchors_all_present_in_prefix": false,
  "appended_lines_that_already_existed_in_prefix": [
   "| rc | 含义 | 判据 |",
   "|---|---|---|",
   "| `1` | harness 失败 | 测试/运行器自身出错：导入失败、夹具错误、期望文件缺失、路径未绑定 |",
   "|---|---|---|"
  ],
  "deleted_content_verdict": "NOT CONFIRMED"
 },
